    {
      "id": "differential/weather-c-after-wind-ends-fields",
      "description": "A c field after the DDD/SSS wind extension is out of place: the fields end there, and the rest (c043s007g...t047h75b10360Yasnoe nebo) is weather-comment text. aprs-rs read on.",
